                    },
                    "message": "if we are here, line 278 returned 0, means it is not present.\nThen we can't say \"Failed to check\" here -\n\"Failed to check if log file parent directory exists\" \n\n\nmay be we can say something like -\n\"Found error - \"  + l_ec.message()"
